          "asr_latency_ms": 265.7,
          "language": "English"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "customer",
          "text": "Um, I mean, it's okay I suppose.",
          "call_time_s": 37.3,
          "duration_s": 3.3,
          "asr_latency_ms": 300.8,
          "language": "English"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "customer",
          "text": "The weather has been terrible so things are a bit, you know, slow to start today.",
          "call_time_s": 40.5,
          "duration_s": 5.4,
          "asr_latency_ms": 549.5,
          "language": "English"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "agent",
          "text": "I understand.",
          "call_time_s": 46.5,
          "duration_s": 1.7,
          "asr_latency_ms": 409.6,
          "language": "English"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "agent",
          "text": "Could you tell me a little about the business?",
          "call_time_s": 48.3,
          "duration_s": 3.1,
          "asr_latency_ms": 363.6,
          "language": "English"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "customer",
          "text": "Yes, it's a small thing, we've been doing it a while.",
          "call_time_s": 55.9,
          "duration_s": 4.3,
          "asr_latency_ms": 391.6,
          "language": "English"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "customer",
          "text": "Nothing very exciting. My cousin also does something similar in another city.",
          "call_time_s": 55.9,
          "duration_s": 6.0,
          "asr_latency_ms": 416.5,
          "language": "English"
